abstract: >-
  A containerized CE-RISE service for calculating environmental impacts using BONSAI and fixed
  EF3.1 factors. It validates Product System and LCI Dataset inputs and Integrated LCA results
  through HEX Core, with isolated calculations and diagnostics.
